# The RPC endpoint, key and all. Copy this file to `.dev.vars` and fill it in.
#
# Read by both ways of running the site locally: `wrangler dev` reads it because
# it is wrangler's own file for local secrets, and the Vite dev server is
# pointed at it too, so there is one file rather than two.
#
# Not needed to deploy. There the same name is a secret on the worker:
#
#   pnpm --filter @prediction-market/web exec wrangler secret put UPSTREAM_RPC_URL
#
# Left unset entirely, the site still runs against the cluster's public
# endpoint, which needs no account and is rate limited hard enough to notice.
UPSTREAM_RPC_URL=https://devnet.your-provider.com/?api-key=...
